{"baseline":{"amendments":[],"id":"heat-spreader-sizing-02-basis","requirements":[{"id":"HEAT02-GEOMETRY","mandatory":true,"review_required":false,"scope":"design","sources":[{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/heat-spreader-sizing/02-camera-cold-wall-link/context.md","locator":"Geometry and model","sha256":"af282b78b6efad69008976c10ef6bdd37f94dbb400b0bcfd190bdc51838383d8"},{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/heat-spreader-sizing/02-camera-cold-wall-link/alternatives.csv","locator":"all rows","sha256":"dcf49dd139d4f4f452978086b388e8d9c90e2d9df4cd6692151d90117c4a48cd"}],"text":"Each candidate is an unperforated 80 mm long, 3 mm thick rectangular plate with declared width 30, 45, or 60 mm, within the 84 mm by 64 mm envelope."},{"id":"HEAT02-BOUNDARIES","mandatory":true,"review_required":true,"scope":"design","sources":[{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/heat-spreader-sizing/02-camera-cold-wall-link/context.md","locator":"Geometry and model","sha256":"af282b78b6efad69008976c10ef6bdd37f94dbb400b0bcfd190bdc51838383d8"},{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/heat-spreader-sizing/02-camera-cold-wall-link/alternatives.csv","locator":"heat_input_w,cold_face_temperature_c","sha256":"dcf49dd139d4f4f452978086b388e8d9c90e2d9df4cd6692151d90117c4a48cd"}],"text":"The numerical model fixes the complete X=0 face at 30 °C, applies total 9 W uniformly to the complete X=80 mm face, and insulates every remaining face."},{"id":"HEAT02-MATERIAL","mandatory":true,"review_required":true,"scope":"design","sources":[{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/heat-spreader-sizing/02-camera-cold-wall-link/context.md","locator":"Geometry and model","sha256":"af282b78b6efad69008976c10ef6bdd37f94dbb400b0bcfd190bdc51838383d8"},{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/heat-spreader-sizing/02-camera-cold-wall-link/alternatives.csv","locator":"conductivity_w_mk,density_kg_m3","sha256":"dcf49dd139d4f4f452978086b388e8d9c90e2d9df4cd6692151d90117c4a48cd"}],"text":"The model uses constant thermal conductivity 167 W/(m·K); density 2700 kg/m³ is used only as a synthetic comparative property."},{"id":"HEAT02-FIELDS","mandatory":true,"review_required":false,"scope":"content","sources":[{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/heat-spreader-sizing/02-camera-cold-wall-link/prompt.txt","locator":"requested numerical fields","sha256":"340c8b111a1d87d5b980a22558a8e1a0f4588491017b61af2e1a856496b651b9"},{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/heat-spreader-sizing/02-camera-cold-wall-link/context.md","locator":"Reporting and company rules","sha256":"af282b78b6efad69008976c10ef6bdd37f94dbb400b0bcfd190bdc51838383d8"}],"text":"All three candidates retain actual coarse and refined numerical temperature fields distinct from the analytical baseline."},{"id":"HEAT02-ANALYTICAL","mandatory":true,"review_required":false,"scope":"design","sources":[{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/heat-spreader-sizing/02-camera-cold-wall-link/context.md","locator":"Geometry and model; Reporting and company rules","sha256":"af282b78b6efad69008976c10ef6bdd37f94dbb400b0bcfd190bdc51838383d8"},{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/heat-spreader-sizing/02-camera-cold-wall-link/alternatives.csv","locator":"all rows","sha256":"dcf49dd139d4f4f452978086b388e8d9c90e2d9df4cd6692151d90117c4a48cd"}],"text":"Each numerical hot-end temperature rise agrees within 2% of Q·L/(k·W·t) using that candidate's declared dimensions and inputs."},{"id":"HEAT02-BALANCE","mandatory":true,"review_required":false,"scope":"design","sources":[{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/heat-spreader-sizing/02-camera-cold-wall-link/prompt.txt","locator":"record heat balance","sha256":"340c8b111a1d87d5b980a22558a8e1a0f4588491017b61af2e1a856496b651b9"},{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/heat-spreader-sizing/02-camera-cold-wall-link/alternatives.csv","locator":"heat_input_w","sha256":"dcf49dd139d4f4f452978086b388e8d9c90e2d9df4cd6692151d90117c4a48cd"}],"text":"Each refined candidate field has total heat removal within 1% of the declared 9 W input."},{"id":"HEAT02-REFINEMENT","mandatory":true,"review_required":false,"scope":"design","sources":[{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/heat-spreader-sizing/02-camera-cold-wall-link/prompt.txt","locator":"record mesh sensitivity","sha256":"340c8b111a1d87d5b980a22558a8e1a0f4588491017b61af2e1a856496b651b9"},{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/heat-spreader-sizing/02-camera-cold-wall-link/context.md","locator":"Reporting and company rules","sha256":"af282b78b6efad69008976c10ef6bdd37f94dbb400b0bcfd190bdc51838383d8"}],"text":"Each candidate's coarse-to-refined hot-end temperature-rise change is at most 2% and retains both mesh identities."},{"id":"HEAT02-OUTCOMES","mandatory":true,"review_required":false,"scope":"design","sources":[{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/heat-spreader-sizing/02-camera-cold-wall-link/alternatives.csv","locator":"all rows","sha256":"dcf49dd139d4f4f452978086b388e8d9c90e2d9df4cd6692151d90117c4a48cd"},{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/heat-spreader-sizing/02-camera-cold-wall-link/prompt.txt","locator":"56 C selection request","sha256":"340c8b111a1d87d5b980a22558a8e1a0f4588491017b61af2e1a856496b651b9"}],"text":"The decision records the computed compliance outcome for 30, 45, and 60 mm widths against the inclusive 56 °C limit without substituting case-01 inputs."},{"id":"HEAT02-SELECTION","mandatory":true,"review_required":false,"scope":"design","sources":[{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/heat-spreader-sizing/02-camera-cold-wall-link/context.md","locator":"Design goals and capabilities","sha256":"af282b